    archimate:identifier "wp6-3-workspace-regenerated-from-the-abox";
    archimate:name "WP6.3 Workspace regenerated from the ABox";
    archimate:documentation "aboxToWorkspace and workspaceToAbox. The ABox stays the source of truth and the workspace is derived on every load. This is the fix for the schema fragility the DHC harness recorded — a saved workspace against older block definitions stops being loadable, and its own README names 'persist the A-Box, regenerate the workspace' as the answer.";
